WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.760
You can hand a small question to another agent
when a separate piece of work needs attention.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:12.532
After you enable subagents, the parent
starts a scout with one focused task.

3
00:00:12.532 --> 00:00:17.800
The widget shows it running. Its answer
then comes back to the parent session.

4
00:00:28.833 --> 00:00:32.236
Give the child the whole
question and the scope.

5
00:00:32.236 --> 00:00:34.433
It starts with its own context.
